First, let's find the prime factorization of \( 2310 \).
\( 2310 = 10 \times 231 = 2 \times 5 \times 3 \times 77 = 2 \times 3 \times 5 \times 7 \times 11 \).
So, \( 2310 = 2^1 \times 3^1 \times 5^1 \times 7^1 \times 11^1 \).

